oracle-to-postgres-migration-advisor

Licensed under the MIT License. See LICENSE for the full text.

This project contains an Oracle to Azure PostgreSQL migration knowledge base, a distilled decision
rule set, an executable decision engine with its tests, a static Oracle schema assessor, a
prerequisite plan generator and a PDF report builder.

Design lineage
--------------
The structure of this project follows fredgis/sql-migration-advisor (https://github.com/fredgis/sql-migration-advisor),
a SQL Server to Azure migration advisor: an interview that produces an input contract with stable IDs, a
hard-eligibility trace over every target family, ranked survivors, method candidates, an output contract with
self-check invariants, rule IDs behind every verdict, an executable mirror of the rules, golden scenarios, a
sources register and a provisional status that never rises above medium confidence. Some asking rules in the
skills are adapted from its skills, because they record failures it observed in real sessions.

