Ora2Pg
------
The cost model in tools/assess reproduces the scoring that Ora2Pg 25.0 documents in its manual and in
lib/Ora2Pg/PLSQL.pm: 5 minutes per unit, 84 units per person-day, the per-construct weights, the object
scores, the migration levels A, B and C. It uses them as a yardstick for the effort estimate and does not recommend, assess or run the tool. This project contains no Ora2Pg source code and does not link to it.
Ora2Pg is licensed under the GNU General Public License v3 (https://github.com/darold/ora2pg). Weights that
come from Ora2Pg are marked `ora2pg-25.0:<KEY>` in reference/compat-catalog.json; all other weights are this
project's own and are marked `advisor`.

